{"type":"text","timestamp":1784789685068,"sessionID":"ses_0723fd70bffejqlQwf4k1RTIyj","part":{"id":"prt_f8dc141f500135fXDTpM0ZSi4Q","messageID":"msg_f8dc13230001hc5EU2mRPHisN9","sessionID":"ses_0723fd70bffejqlQwf4k1RTIyj","type":"text","text":"The constructor with the most points at the Monaco Grand Prix between 1980 and 2010 is **McLaren**.\n\n| Constructor | Nationality | Total Points |\n|-------------|-------------|--------------|\n| McLaren | British | 218.5 |\n\nMcLaren scored 218.5 points, followed by Ferrari (194.5) and Williams (117.5).\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer:** McLaren (British) scored the most points at the Monaco Grand Prix between 1980 and 2010, with a total of 218.5 points.\n\n**Evidence SQL:**\n```sql\nSELECT c.name AS constructor_name, c.nationality, SUM(cr.points) AS total_points FROM constructorResults cr JOIN races r ON cr.raceId = r.raceId JOIN circuits ci ON r.circuitId = ci.circuitId JOIN constructors c ON cr.constructorId = c.constructorId WHERE ci.circuitId = 6 AND r.year BETWEEN 1980 AND 2010 GROUP BY c.constructorId ORDER BY total_points DESC LIMIT 1\n```","time":{"start":1784789680629,"end":1784789685063}}}
